OL,3,GNEWSAEMR warns of 'extremely busy'
OL,4,Aweekend due to works
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) has warned
OL,7,Fthat services to and from London St
OL,8,FPancras are expected to be "extremely
OL,9,Fbusy" over the last weekend of
OL,10,FNovember.
OL,12,FEMR said it was advising customers to
OL,13,Fonly travel "if essential" on 28 and 29
OL,14,FNovember, due to major engineering
OL,15,Fworks taking place on the East Coast
OL,16,FMain Line.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
