OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAEMR warns of 'extremely busy'
OL,4,Aweekend due to works
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the affected weekend, there will
OL,7,Fbe no London and North Eastern Railway
OL,8,F(LNER) trains between London King's
OL,9,FCross and Peterborough as part of
OL,10,Fdigital signalling upgrades by Network
OL,11,FRail, EMR said. As a result, EMR
OL,12,Fservices to and from London St Pancras
OL,13,Fwere expected to be extremely busy.
OL,15,FEMR advised customers to allow extra
OL,16,Ftime and consider travelling on a
OL,17,Fweekday if possible.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
